&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role is remote located in the UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;Tulip&lt;/a&gt; brings modern technology and AI into manufacturing. Manufacturing accounts for almost 20% of the global economy and one in every seven workers on Earth, yet remains among the least digitized. More than a decade ago, we created the category to close that gap: AI-native software that puts cutting-edge tools directly in the hands of the people on the manufacturing front lines. Because we are human-centered and tech-obsessed, we are building a future of work where human ingenuity is amplified with the latest technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In January 2026 we became one of Boston&#39;s few new AI unicorns, reaching a $1.3B valuation. We&#39;re growing double digits in revenue year over year. The world&#39;s best manufacturers run on Tulip - turning inventory 10x faster, releasing gene therapies in hours instead of weeks, and training master craftspeople to forge engagement rings 5x more rapidly. Headquartered in Somerville, MA with offices in Germany, Hungary, Singapore, Japan, and Israel, we&#39;ve been consistently named a World Economic Forum Global Innovator, a Gartner leader, and one of Built In Boston&#39;s &quot;Best Places to Work.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We run the way we build: AI-forward, humanistic, and high ownership. We&#39;re looking for builders who are energized by complex problems, rapid cycles, and the unique opportunity to see their impact on a global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are driven by new business development and have a proven track record of managing the full sales cycle for SaaS solutions in the manufacturing industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially-minded and thrive in environments that are scaling quickly, and you&#39;re excited to contribute to building new processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a customer-centric approach, with a genuine desire to listen to and learn from clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a hands-on mentality and are adept at managing large, complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What skills do I need?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of experience in an Account Executive role, selling complex software solutions into the manufacturing sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the UK manufacturing industry is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consistent track record of achieving and exceeding sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communications skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trained/certified in value-selling sales methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive, can-do attitude is a key quality to succeed on the Tulip team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce.com is a plus; organize / report on all sales productivity on a consistent basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn Salesforce, Outreach, Zoominfo, Linkedin Sales Navigator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cross functional collaborations and contributions to building highly functional commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break into and drive large, complex deals through lead to close. Experience navigating large company procurement processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive account strategies and account plans to execute a sales process and win deals within assigned accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple customer opportunities with multiple partners at once while maintaining a high level of attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build accurate forecasting and an operational cadence with management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive referenceable customer satisfaction in your accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertly demonstrate Tulip technology to end users and execute opportunities with channel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have passion for technology and speak fluently about current trends related to SaaS, PaaS, IoT, and cloud solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop champions, stakeholder mind-share, and close at the VP/C-level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a planner and lead the preparation of client engagements across internal and partner stakeholders to speed deal cycle times.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage and collaborate with internal/external resources as a team player; Professional Services, Pre Sales Engineering, Marketing, Channel Partners, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Collaborators:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre Sales Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel and Alliances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working At Tulip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know even great candidates experience imposter syndrome. Even if you don’t match every requirement, applying gives you the opportunity to be considered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a strong, diverse team that values hard work, families, and personal well-being. Benefits of working with us include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company equity: Share in the success you help create.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holiday Allowance: Unlimited vacation policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development: A dedicated budget for your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. At Tulip, we celebrate all. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. Help us build an inclusive community that will transform frontline operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note that we may use AI-based tools to support parts of our hiring process. All data processing is carried out in compliance with local data protection laws, ensuring all personal candidate information is handled securely and ethically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a high-performing sales team within the DACH sales organization, responsible for driving growth within large global enterprises from the Manufacturing industry. Manufacturing is one of our strategic industries, where we help global leaders optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will create and cultivate strategic relationships to drive sales cycles from deep discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a selected portfolio of strategic accounts from the Manufacturing industry headquartered in Switzerland, generating new business opportunities with existing customers. Navigating complex organizations up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts&#39; needs and systematically drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will primarily work and manage existing customers, land-and-expand is the typical model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross line-of-business at C-level and below&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence &amp;amp; Enterprise AI sales motions &lt;strong&gt;across the entire core enterprise value chain,&lt;/strong&gt; translating core challenges into &lt;strong&gt;compelling, AI-enabled use cases&lt;/strong&gt; that deliver &lt;strong&gt;measurable execution capacity&lt;/strong&gt; against &lt;strong&gt;strategic customer pain points.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold an individual revenue target for closing seven-figure deals within your accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage closely with partners e.g, consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;○ &lt;strong&gt;SaaS Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex, strategic business solutions to large enterprise accounts with full account ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;○ &lt;strong&gt;AI / Management Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, driving AI projects with direct responsibility for account management, client relationships, business development / client acquisition and carrying your own net new revenue quota&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of commitment, long tenure, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;successful career progression&lt;/strong&gt; with your previous companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;business acumen&lt;/strong&gt; and a deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;core processes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;KPIs&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the entire enterprise value chain in the Manufacturing industry, particularly within the domains of Production, Supply Chain, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Manufacturing industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build trusted relationships with senior Business and IT stakeholders and engage effectively at the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;C-level&lt;/strong&gt; (CFO, COO, CIO, VP Operations, Manufacturing Director, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit&lt;/strong&gt;, a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;strong discovery&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;sales process leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in German&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, with exceptional communication and presentation skills to engage and excite stakeholders effectively at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;positivity, creative thinking, &lt;/strong&gt;and a&lt;strong&gt; growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;/li&gt;
