&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed quota while fostering strong customer relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the value of GitLab to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/sales/#market-segmentation&quot;&gt;Commercial&lt;/a&gt; prospects and customers in the US Eastern region&lt;/li&gt;
